@PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Health
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/health
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/health/pi
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ollama

### API docs (Scalar)
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/scalar/v1
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### Milestone: deterministic tag details
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tags/Plant1.Boiler03.SteamPressure

### Search / history
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tags/search?q=steam
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tags/history?reference=Plant1.Boiler03.SteamPressure

### Alias resolution
GET {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tags/Boiler03.SteamPressure

### Tag Assistant (Ollama + PI/catalog tools)
POST {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Tell me everything about Plant1.Boiler03.SteamPressure. Include current value, unit, source, and related tags."
}

### Raw local Ollama chat (no tools — model smoke test)
POST {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/ollama
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Reply with one short sentence confirming you are online."
}

### Raw Qwen Online chat (no tools — requires QwenOnline:Enabled + ApiKey)
POST {{PiAiAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/qwen-online
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Reply with one short sentence confirming you are online."
}
